  ],
  "duration_s": 506.344828,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们说到一九七零年五十四岁的黄伟路，临危受命，当了中国第一枚潜地固体导弹巨浪一号的总设计师，可么叫潜地导弹，就是从潜艇水下发射的战略导弹陆地上的导弹，敌人卫星看得见。找得到可藏在深海里的导弹，你永远不知道它在哪。这就是一个一个国家最后的底牌。二次战略反击能力。说白了，有了这个东西，就算陆地全被端了，深海里还有一支力量能还手。有了它，谁也不敢轻易动武，可这东西太难了，海水有压力，潜艇在摇晃，水下通信是难题，导弹出水那一瞬间的控制更是难上加难。没有资料，没有经验，连个可以参考的样品都没有，怎么搞？黄伟禄说了四个字，自力更生。第一个大难题就是测导弹模型，从高空落水的数据没有试验场怎么办？黄伟禄一拍大腿去南京长江大桥。一九七零年七月，南京长江大桥上出现了一幕让路人目瞪口呆的场景，一台大吊车把十几吨重的模型蛋从桥上往长江里扔，各种角度扔，扔了捞捞了人。当时是三伏天，桥上的铁蛋体被太阳晒得滚烫，里面温度超过五十度，跟蒸笼一样快。六十岁的黄伟禄光着膀子跟年轻小伙子一样，每天钻进弹体里检查数据出来的时候，整个人像从水里捞出来的，浑身长满痱子。晚上就住简易工棚，蚊子成群，闷热难耐，席子上都能印出一个人形汉字。他们就是用这种土办法，拿一身的痱子，换来了宝贵的试验数据。这一干就是十二年十二年，四千多个日日夜夜，黄伟禄带着团队从一张白纸开始，硬生生把这条路趟出来了。一九八二年十月七日，渤海海面上万众瞩目巨浪一号首次水下发射试验，开始了。点火导弹出水，然后失控了。导弹在空中偏离方向，超出安全范围，被安全引爆。全场鸦雀无声，几千人十几年的心血就这么没了，所有人的目光都集中在总设计师黄伟路一个人身上，那几天压力像山一样压过来。有人说是不是设计有问题，有人说是不是应该推迟。黄伟禄一句话没说把自己关在房间里，把导弹的每一个数据、每一个动作、每一道流程在脑子里过了一遍又一遍，最后查出来了原因，小的让人心碎。一个分离插头提前脱落了，就这么一个小零件毁了一次发射。十月十二日第二次发射，这一次，黄伟路顶住了所有压力，坚定的说，设计没问题。结构没问题，可以发射。上午发射命令下达渤海海面。一条喷火的蛟龙破水而出，腾空而起，穿云破雾直刺苍穹，成功了圆满成功。现场所有人抱在一起哭的哭喊的喊，中国，成为了世界上第五个掌握水下潜射导弹技术的国家，茫茫大海从此有了我们中国人的钢铁长城。可当大家欢呼胜利的时候，没人注意到慌黄纬路已经受的脱了刑。短短几个月，他的体重掉了整整十一公斤。二十二集呢同事看着他，含着眼泪说，黄总，您这是把自己的血肉都补在导弹上了啊。黄伟路笑了笑，说了一句，让所有人都忘不了的话。十一公斤比起成吨重的导弹算不了什么，但能用这一身血肉换来民族的希望和骄傲，值了。后来，黄伟路又提出了一个大胆的想法，一旦两用，把海里的巨浪一号班上岸，改成陆机机动固体战略导弹，这就是后来大名鼎鼎的东风。二十一、他还给团队定了一条规矩，叫四共同有问题。共同研究有困难，共同克服有余量，共同掌握有风险，共同承担这条规矩。到今天还是中国航天的金科玉律，他对自己更狠，定了个三个三、在基地跟工人一起排队买饭，一起搞卫生，一起搞卫生，出差能走就行，有饭吃就行，有地方睡就行。公车私人外出不用接送亲友，不用家人有事儿不大。一个为国家立下不世之功的人，对自己竟然苛刻到了这种地步。一九九九年，八十三岁的黄伟禄被授予两弹一星功勋奖章。直到这时候，很多人才第一次知道这个慈祥的老人竟然为中国的导弹事业隐姓埋名了大半辈子。二零一一年十一月二十三日，九十五岁的黄伟路走完了他的一生，临终前，他用尽最后的力气说了那句话，假如有来生，我还要搞导弹。他这一辈子只干了一件事，高导弹从伦敦废墟里的那个青年到渤海之滨的白发老人，他用一生兑现了二十七岁那年在废墟前许下的诺言。今天东风浩荡巨浪滔天，我们能安安稳稳过日子，就是因为有黄伟路这样的人，用血肉之躯为我们筑起了一道看不见的钢铁长城。其实啊黄纬路只是千千万万为国奉献的科学家中的一位，像他这样隐姓埋名，拿命换国家底气的人，还有太多太多。钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、余敏每一位的故事。单拎出来都能让你看的红了眼眶。我最近一直在翻一本书，叫国之脊梁，里面就真真实实记录了这些先辈的真实经历。没有流量明星，没有八卦炒作，全是实打实的撑起咱们民族腰杆的人和事。书的链接，我放在视频左下角了，感兴趣的朋友可以直接拍下，拿到手，细细品读。如果你也被这位老人感动了，麻烦点个赞，把这条视频收藏起来，转发给身边的朋友，让更多人记住黄伟路这三个字。评论区留下一句黄老，谢谢您下棋。我们接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 590,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 590,
      "end_ms": 5250,
      "text": "咱们说到一九七零年五十四岁的黄伟路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5690,
      "end_ms": 6750,
      "text": "临危受命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7090,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "当了中国第一枚潜地固体导弹巨浪一号的总设计师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 15070,
      "text": "可么叫潜地导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15590,
      "end_ms": 21230,
      "text": "就是从潜艇水下发射的战略导弹陆地上的导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 21530,
      "end_ms": 23090,
      "text": "敌人卫星看得见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23310,
      "end_ms": 26790,
      "text": "找得到可藏在深海里的导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 27110,
      "end_ms": 28890,
      "text": "你永远不知道它在哪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "这就是一个一个国家最后的底牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31960,
      "end_ms": 33580,
      "text": "二次战略反击能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34420,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "说白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 37040,
      "text": "有了这个东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37160,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "就算陆地全被端了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39520,
      "end_ms": 42020,
      "text": "深海里还有一支力量能还手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42800,
      "end_ms": 43500,
      "text": "有了它，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44100,
      "end_ms": 46020,
      "text": "谁也不敢轻易动武，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47060,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "可这东西太难了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49320,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "text": "海水有压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52160,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "潜艇在摇晃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53920,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "水下通信是难题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56480,
      "end_ms": 61525,
      "text": "导弹出水那一瞬间的控制更是难上加难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62220,
      "end_ms": 63060,
      "text": "没有资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63280,
      "end_ms": 64185,
      "text": "没有经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64750,
      "end_ms": 67635,
      "text": "连个可以参考的样品都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69200,
      "end_ms": 69735,
      "text": "怎么搞？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70230,
      "end_ms": 72055,
      "text": "黄伟禄说了四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72480,
      "end_ms": 73425,
      "text": "自力更生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74160,
      "end_ms": 77230,
      "text": "第一个大难题就是测导弹模型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77250,
      "end_ms": 82085,
      "text": "从高空落水的数据没有试验场怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83290,
      "end_ms": 87145,
      "text": "黄伟禄一拍大腿去南京长江大桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88230,
      "end_ms": 89815,
      "text": "一九七零年七月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90710,
      "end_ms": 96845,
      "text": "南京长江大桥上出现了一幕让路人目瞪口呆的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 97380,
      "end_ms": 103375,
      "text": "一台大吊车把十几吨重的模型蛋从桥上往长江里扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 103820,
      "end_ms": 104935,
      "text": "各种角度扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 105280,
      "end_ms": 106605,
      "text": "扔了捞捞了人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107450,
      "end_ms": 108785,
      "text": "当时是三伏天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109270,
      "end_ms": 111955,
      "text": "桥上的铁蛋体被太阳晒得滚烫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 112500,
      "end_ms": 114625,
      "text": "里面温度超过五十度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 115530,
      "end_ms": 117070,
      "text": "跟蒸笼一样快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 117170,
      "end_ms": 122510,
      "text": "六十岁的黄伟禄光着膀子跟年轻小伙子一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122830,
      "end_ms": 126650,
      "text": "每天钻进弹体里检查数据出来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 126910,
      "end_ms": 129270,
      "text": "整个人像从水里捞出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129450,
      "end_ms": 131130,
      "text": "浑身长满痱子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 131610,
      "end_ms": 133710,
      "text": "晚上就住简易工棚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134230,
      "end_ms": 135190,
      "text": "蚊子成群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 135650,
      "end_ms": 136750,
      "text": "闷热难耐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 137310,
      "end_ms": 140410,
      "text": "席子上都能印出一个人形汉字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141050,
      "end_ms": 143090,
      "text": "他们就是用这种土办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 143390,
      "end_ms": 144890,
      "text": "拿一身的痱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 145210,
      "end_ms": 147650,
      "text": "换来了宝贵的试验数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 148090,
      "end_ms": 153010,
      "text": "这一干就是十二年十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 153430,
      "end_ms": 155530,
      "text": "四千多个日日夜夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 156710,
      "end_ms": 161870,
      "text": "黄伟禄带着团队从一张白纸开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 162030,
      "end_ms": 164310,
      "text": "硬生生把这条路趟出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 165490,
      "end_ms": 167550,
      "text": "一九八二年十月七日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 168070,
      "end_ms": 174850,
      "text": "渤海海面上万众瞩目巨浪一号首次水下发射试验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 175170,
      "end_ms": 175870,
      "text": "开始了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 177470,
      "end_ms": 181900,
      "text": "点火导弹出水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 182440,
      "end_ms": 183940,
      "text": "然后失控了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 184780,
      "end_ms": 186940,
      "text": "导弹在空中偏离方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 187120,
      "end_ms": 188620,
      "text": "超出安全范围，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 188880,
      "end_ms": 190220,
      "text": "被安全引爆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 190740,
      "end_ms": 192380,
      "text": "全场鸦雀无声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 193080,
      "end_ms": 196380,
      "text": "几千人十几年的心血就这么没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 197900,
      "end_ms": 204340,
      "text": "所有人的目光都集中在总设计师黄伟路一个人身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 204920,
      "end_ms": 207640,
      "text": "那几天压力像山一样压过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 208540,
      "end_ms": 211630,
      "text": "有人说是不是设计有问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 212610,
      "end_ms": 214850,
      "text": "有人说是不是应该推迟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 215670,
      "end_ms": 219030,
      "text": "黄伟禄一句话没说把自己关在房间里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 219890,
      "end_ms": 226690,
      "text": "把导弹的每一个数据、每一个动作、每一道流程在脑子里过了一遍又一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 227170,
      "end_ms": 228810,
      "text": "最后查出来了原因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 228810,
      "end_ms": 229990,
      "text": "小的让人心碎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 230990,
      "end_ms": 233630,
      "text": "一个分离插头提前脱落了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 235270,
      "end_ms": 238310,
      "text": "就这么一个小零件毁了一次发射。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 238690,
      "end_ms": 241160,
      "text": "十月十二日第二次发射，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 241340,
      "end_ms": 241945,
      "text": "这一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 242300,
      "end_ms": 244385,
      "text": "黄伟路顶住了所有压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 244770,
      "end_ms": 245625,
      "text": "坚定的说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 246140,
      "end_ms": 247280,
      "text": "设计没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 247540,
      "end_ms": 248640,
      "text": "结构没问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 248940,
      "end_ms": 249785,
      "text": "可以发射。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 250200,
      "end_ms": 253715,
      "text": "上午发射命令下达渤海海面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 254290,
      "end_ms": 257065,
      "text": "一条喷火的蛟龙破水而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 257680,
      "end_ms": 258700,
      "text": "腾空而起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 258940,
      "end_ms": 261595,
      "text": "穿云破雾直刺苍穹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 261960,
      "end_ms": 263995,
      "text": "成功了圆满成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 264810,
      "end_ms": 268625,
      "text": "现场所有人抱在一起哭的哭喊的喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 268940,
      "end_ms": 269420,
      "text": "中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 269780,
      "end_ms": 274275,
      "text": "成为了世界上第五个掌握水下潜射导弹技术的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 274670,
      "end_ms": 280150,
      "text": "茫茫大海从此有了我们中国人的钢铁长城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 280350,
      "end_ms": 282410,
      "text": "可当大家欢呼胜利的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 282590,
      "end_ms": 286225,
      "text": "没人注意到慌黄纬路已经受的脱了刑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 286840,
      "end_ms": 287960,
      "text": "短短几个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 288280,
      "end_ms": 290835,
      "text": "他的体重掉了整整十一公斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 291240,
      "end_ms": 293890,
      "text": "二十二集呢同事看着他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 294050,
      "end_ms": 294890,
      "text": "含着眼泪说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 295230,
      "end_ms": 295825,
      "text": "黄总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 296160,
      "end_ms": 300290,
      "text": "您这是把自己的血肉都补在导弹上了啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 300530,
      "end_ms": 301630,
      "text": "黄伟路笑了笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 301870,
      "end_ms": 302410,
      "text": "说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 302410,
      "end_ms": 303925,
      "text": "让所有人都忘不了的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 304430,
      "end_ms": 308750,
      "text": "十一公斤比起成吨重的导弹算不了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 309170,
      "end_ms": 314030,
      "text": "但能用这一身血肉换来民族的希望和骄傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 314030,
      "end_ms": 314550,
      "text": "值了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 316230,
      "end_ms": 316710,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 316970,
      "end_ms": 319350,
      "text": "黄伟路又提出了一个大胆的想法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 319530,
      "end_ms": 320350,
      "text": "一旦两用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 320770,
      "end_ms": 323290,
      "text": "把海里的巨浪一号班上岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 323710,
      "end_ms": 326410,
      "text": "改成陆机机动固体战略导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 326750,
      "end_ms": 329390,
      "text": "这就是后来大名鼎鼎的东风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 329410,
      "end_ms": 332690,
      "text": "二十一、他还给团队定了一条规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 333070,
      "end_ms": 335740,
      "text": "叫四共同有问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 335740,
      "end_ms": 337740,
      "text": "共同研究有困难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 337800,
      "end_ms": 339840,
      "text": "共同克服有余量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340040,
      "end_ms": 341940,
      "text": "共同掌握有风险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 342120,
      "end_ms": 344860,
      "text": "共同承担这条规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 345300,
      "end_ms": 349480,
      "text": "到今天还是中国航天的金科玉律，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 349620,
      "end_ms": 350660,
      "text": "他对自己更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 350920,
      "end_ms": 355280,
      "text": "定了个三个三、在基地跟工人一起排队买饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 355460,
      "end_ms": 356420,
      "text": "一起搞卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 356700,
      "end_ms": 357780,
      "text": "一起搞卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 358020,
      "end_ms": 359580,
      "text": "出差能走就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 359920,
      "end_ms": 360960,
      "text": "有饭吃就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 361220,
      "end_ms": 362340,
      "text": "有地方睡就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 362900,
      "end_ms": 366090,
      "text": "公车私人外出不用接送亲友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 366090,
      "end_ms": 368285,
      "text": "不用家人有事儿不大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 369160,
      "end_ms": 371545,
      "text": "一个为国家立下不世之功的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 371890,
      "end_ms": 374565,
      "text": "对自己竟然苛刻到了这种地步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 375600,
      "end_ms": 376745,
      "text": "一九九九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 377240,
      "end_ms": 382805,
      "text": "八十三岁的黄伟禄被授予两弹一星功勋奖章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 383820,
      "end_ms": 384880,
      "text": "直到这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 384900,
      "end_ms": 393035,
      "text": "很多人才第一次知道这个慈祥的老人竟然为中国的导弹事业隐姓埋名了大半辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 393980,
      "end_ms": 396135,
      "text": "二零一一年十一月二十三日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 396440,
      "end_ms": 399535,
      "text": "九十五岁的黄伟路走完了他的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 400090,
      "end_ms": 400895,
      "text": "临终前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 401360,
      "end_ms": 404465,
      "text": "他用尽最后的力气说了那句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 405030,
      "end_ms": 406235,
      "text": "假如有来生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 406660,
      "end_ms": 407835,
      "text": "我还要搞导弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 408430,
      "end_ms": 411485,
      "text": "他这一辈子只干了一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 412290,
      "end_ms": 419575,
      "text": "高导弹从伦敦废墟里的那个青年到渤海之滨的白发老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 420530,
      "end_ms": 425965,
      "text": "他用一生兑现了二十七岁那年在废墟前许下的诺言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 426750,
      "end_ms": 430355,
      "text": "今天东风浩荡巨浪滔天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 430920,
      "end_ms": 433025,
      "text": "我们能安安稳稳过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 433400,
      "end_ms": 435685,
      "text": "就是因为有黄伟路这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 436280,
      "end_ms": 441735,
      "text": "用血肉之躯为我们筑起了一道看不见的钢铁长城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00147",
      "start_ms": 442700,
      "end_ms": 449805,
      "text": "其实啊黄纬路只是千千万万为国奉献的科学家中的一位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00148",
      "start_ms": 450700,
      "end_ms": 452905,
      "text": "像他这样隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00149",
      "start_ms": 453440,
      "end_ms": 455375,
      "text": "拿命换国家底气的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00150",
      "start_ms": 455770,
      "end_ms": 457015,
      "text": "还有太多太多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00151",
      "start_ms": 457990,
      "end_ms": 462590,
      "text": "钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、余敏每一位的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00152",
      "start_ms": 462590,
      "end_ms": 465675,
      "text": "单拎出来都能让你看的红了眼眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00153",
      "start_ms": 466370,
      "end_ms": 468155,
      "text": "我最近一直在翻一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00154",
      "start_ms": 468580,
      "end_ms": 469935,
      "text": "叫国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00155",
      "start_ms": 470470,
      "end_ms": 474545,
      "text": "里面就真真实实记录了这些先辈的真实经历。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00156",
      "start_ms": 475200,
      "end_ms": 476340,
      "text": "没有流量明星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00157",
      "start_ms": 476600,
      "end_ms": 477820,
      "text": "没有八卦炒作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00158",
      "start_ms": 478180,
      "end_ms": 482335,
      "text": "全是实打实的撑起咱们民族腰杆的人和事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00159",
      "start_ms": 482850,
      "end_ms": 483590,
      "text": "书的链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00160",
      "start_ms": 483590,
      "end_ms": 485075,
      "text": "我放在视频左下角了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00161",
      "start_ms": 485340,
      "end_ms": 487345,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友可以直接拍下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00162",
      "start_ms": 487740,
      "end_ms": 488320,
      "text": "拿到手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00163",
      "start_ms": 488320,
      "end_ms": 489255,
      "text": "细细品读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00164",
      "start_ms": 489610,
      "end_ms": 491565,
      "text": "如果你也被这位老人感动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00165",
      "start_ms": 491890,
      "end_ms": 492770,
      "text": "麻烦点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00166",
      "start_ms": 492790,
      "end_ms": 494765,
      "text": "把这条视频收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00167",
      "start_ms": 495170,
      "end_ms": 496945,
      "text": "转发给身边的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00168",
      "start_ms": 497500,
      "end_ms": 500805,
      "text": "让更多人记住黄伟路这三个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00169",
      "start_ms": 501630,
      "end_ms": 503365,
      "text": "评论区留下一句黄老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00170",
      "start_ms": 503790,
      "end_ms": 505170,
      "text": "谢谢您下棋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e088f3c45c96789c_s00171",
      "start_ms": 505520,
      "end_ms": 506225,
      "text": "我们接着讲。"
    }
  ],
